// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Dialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DialogStartPage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P2654003668" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Yo, {HeroName}, it's Wrencher, guy you're meeting with.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We got a problem, PPD chased us right into a den of ghouls! Our boys could use your help!"
// SaysList :
"P3284642018" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>See down there? That's day to day in the tunnels, trying our best not to get chomped.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We get out of here fast enough, we can scamp and let them PPD badgers and Ghouls chomp - wha?! Hold on, {HeroName}, we're under attack! It's the PPD!"
// SaysList :
"P3793101891" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>PPD found us, {HeroName}, watch out!<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>You might run into a few of 'em yourself up ahead!"
// SaysList :
"P2355477643" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Ugh! Hey give that radio ba-!"
// SaysList :
"P1554719535" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Word on the street is that you ain't too pleased with being part of the Powers Division.<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We could use more folks like you, people willin' to talk back to them guys in power. We meet up, we can - wha?! Hold on {HeroName}, it's the PPD!"

