// SaysList :
"P225196890" "Let's show this Powers Division that the PPD can still take down scum like Wrencher!"
// SaysList :
"P2458738336" "Help me out of this by taking out these guys, {HeroName}!"
// SaysList :
"P3652444424" "Whew, almost got myself slammed there!<em=lecture f=a>Gotta say, it's good havin' you on our side.<em=lecture f=a>We gotta figure out a game plan before you head topside, come talk to me."
// SaysList :
"P845914902" "Well done.<em=lecture f=a>You have proven your loyalty to the Emperor.<em=lecture f=a>Come here, I need to talk to you."
// SaysList :
"P3085029734" "Good luck, with Praetor White. The Powers Division is not an easy job."
// SaysList :
"P3596355182" "Be careful with Praetor White. He's got a sixth sense when it comes to finding spies.<em>You're going to have to play the part of a Powers Division completely."
// SaysList :
"P1532814662" "I trusted you {HeroName}, I won't make the same mistake twice!"
// SaysList :
"P1000875998" "You're just another enemy of the state then, {HeroName}."

